  "readme": "# Fresh ordinary full16 under scout observer execution H\n\nRoot ran a new isolated two-account ordinary protocol lifecycle: all16 checks passed,351 ordinary sent commands, six capacity counters zero before/after, normal exit0 and first no-loot attempt preserved. [Actual independent audit](public/1792963900426-f1496383.independent-audit.json), [protocol report](public/1792963911146-f4437694.report.json), [realm evidence](public/1792963900426-f1496383.realm-evidence.json) and [Root OS cleanup](execution/scout-observer-full16-root-independent-cleanup-v1.json) bind realm1792963900426-f1496383/run1792963911146-f4437694.\n\nThe backend remains original c743/50/dae1. Execution and capacity Node driver are H=3a6d8c862d03ded3133605472a8f38bc6258af52; the original Release keeps historical driver d240. No new Rust build or Release was made. [Source verification](public/1792963900426-f1496383.source-manifest-verification.json), [runtime reader](source/runtime/source-lib-v1.mjs), [current binding](source/runtime/current-execution-binding-v1.json) and [Root actual readonly check](source/runtime/scout-observer-runtime-readonly-guard-stdout-v1.log) preserve these distinct identities. The six full16 ordinary driver pins are independent of capacity Node9/[actual219 source tests](source/scout-observer-preference-root-full-driver-receipt-v1.json). Historical341 commands are not this351 result.\n\n[Prepared v2 QA](review/prepared-review-v2.json) and [actual result QA](review/scout-observer-full16-actual-independent-review-v1.json) are separate. The preparation tool path-separator correction was made before any full16 execution; old v1 preparation/review remain original external history. [Root finalization output](execution/scout-observer-full16-root-finalize-stdout-v2.log), [run output](execution/scout-observer-full16-root-run-stdout-v1.log), [audit output](execution/scout-observer-full16-root-audit-stdout-v1.log) and [exact16 prerequisite pins](full16-actual-prerequisite-v1.json) preserve actual execution evidence.\n\nThe six public traces are copied byte-for-byte after Root audit. This archive only hashes/copies them; it does not re-execute the audit or replay packets. No private data, executable or recording is copied. Capacity/P0 acceptance remains false, human frontend acceptance is absent, P2 remains frozen. This successful full16 is not a new probe18 or formal result. Original backend build evidence remains in the [existing Release archive](../capacity-account-store-wait-diagnostics-release-v1/README.md).\n"
}
